{
  "slug": "nexusfeed-ltl-fuel-surcharges",
  "name": "Nexusfeed Ltl Fuel Surcharges",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Real-time LTL freight carrier fuel surcharge rates for AI agents. Covers 11 carriers (ODFL, Saia, Estes, ABF, R+L, TForce, XPO, SEFL, Averitt, FedEx, UPS). Every response includes a _verifiability block with extraction confidence, source timestamp, and evidence URL. Installed via uvx, authenticated with MCP_API_KEY env var.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 MCP servers**, `nexusfeed-ltl`, `nexusfeed-abc`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install nexusfeed-ltl-fuel-surcharges@claude-community` from `NexusFeed/nexusfeed-mcp`.\n\nReal-time LTL freight fuel surcharge rates and US state ABC liquor license compliance records — served as normalized, verifiable JSON for AI agents via the Model Context Protocol.",
